Package: dwell
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, git
Description: Dotfile manager with type-safe modules and plugins
 dwell unifies your dotfiles across machines with multiple
 template engines (Handlebars, Rhai, Tera), cross-platform
 package management, age encryption, and a WASM/Lua plugin system.
